* A branch to a constant (an equate, a number, an expression of them), not a label: both r68s
* take the constant for the displacement itself, no relocation (bhi Disp, Disp an equate of 14:
* $6200 $000E); as branched to address 14. db<cc> the same.
* fixed: 0e06269 2026-10-12 r68togas: a branch to a constant takes it for the displacement, as both r68s
* expect text: 4e71600e 6200000e 61000010 51c9000e 4e714e71
Disp equ 14
 psect branch_const,0,0,0,0,0
 nop
 bra.s Disp
 bhi Disp
 bsr.w Disp+2
 dbf d1,14
 nop
 ends
